@startuml
title PlantUML Export Demo

actor User
participant "Zed Code Action" as Action
participant "Native helper / LSP" as Helper
participant "PlantUML Renderer" as Renderer

User -> Action : choose SVG / PNG / PDF
Action -> Helper : workspace/executeCommand
note right of Helper : same helper process
Helper -> Renderer : render sample.puml
Renderer --> Helper : write image file
Helper --> User : output ready

@enduml
